  "label": "Bruce Jenner is mapped onto Frankenstein's monster",
  "description": "The text 'it used to belong to bruce jenner!' explicitly maps Bruce Jenner (a real person) onto the visual entity of the Frankenstein's monster wax figure. The meme uses the horror imagery of the monster as a metaphor for Bruce Jenner's identity, implying he is 'unnatural' or 'monstrous' due to his transition. This is an analogical mapping where the textual reference to Bruce Jenner is projected onto the visual representation of the monster.",
